    "summary": "Register 1987\r\nA figure of mud, straw and wood in the form of a naked woman. When recovered from the donor, the head, legs and arms were detached from the torso. When originally collected by the donor, the figure was standing upright, the legs and torso being of one piece, though the arms and head were detachable. A layer of darker brown mud has been applied to the lower torsoand legs; the breasts, upper torso and head are of a paler terracotta colour.",
